(1949846, 268321, 29474, '<td valign="top">This looks like something that Lesley Goodman would do. But it looks a bit over-sharpened to me. Otherwise a great capture and the look on his face says it all.</td>', 'This looks like something that Lesley Goodman would do. But it looks a bit over-sharpened to me. Otherwise a great capture and the look on his face says it all.', '2005-12-14 05:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1949848, 268899, 19474, '<td valign="top">nice shot... I think there is a little too much sky, cropping half the sky above the tallest tower to give a more panoramic shot would help and while you have the water line perfectly horizontal (I checked) the tall building on the left unbalances the shot and makes that side appear higher, half a deg counter clockwise would fix that :)<br/>the photo has an overall blue cast to it this may have been intentional but I think playing with the white balance a bit would make this shot pop<br/>this shot has lots of potential ~ 6</td>', 'nice shot... I think there is a little too much sky, cropping half the sky above the tallest tower to give a more panoramic shot would help and while you have the water line perfectly horizontal (I checked) the tall building on the left unbalances the shot and makes that side appear higher, half a deg counter clockwise would fix that :)the photo has an overall blue cast to it this may have been intentional but I think playing with the white balance a bit would make this shot popthis shot has lots of potential ~ 6', '2005-12-14 05:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
