(1950055, 268848, 27482, '<td valign="top">Hmm, not going to vote off topic but it really doesn´t look like it´s taken at 4 or 5 in the morning, way too bright outside and the only place this time of year that it´s bright enough for a photo like this at that hour is in the south pole and this doesn´t look like it´s from there....  This shot is way way too flat for my taste, would appeal more to me if it had a lot more contrast.</td>', 'Hmm, not going to vote off topic but it really doesn´t look like it´s taken at 4 or 5 in the morning, way too bright outside and the only place this time of year that it´s bright enough for a photo like this at that hour is in the south pole and this doesn´t look like it´s from there....  This shot is way way too flat for my taste, would appeal more to me if it had a lot more contrast.', '2005-12-14 07:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
