(1953551, 268046, 23394, '<td valign="top">as a challenge entry, this offers me no context for time (other than the title).  as an image, i can barely recognize the subject as being candles.  the coloring and post-processing seem rather haphazard and without purpose.  this really looks like it would have been better un-submitted.</td>', 'as a challenge entry, this offers me no context for time (other than the title).  as an image, i can barely recognize the subject as being candles.  the coloring and post-processing seem rather haphazard and without purpose.  this really looks like it would have been better un-submitted.', '2005-12-15 10:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
