(1953561, 268338, 23394, '<td valign="top">as an image, this spot might have some potential, but the water is not that appealling at the moment.  the blown out area needs to be reigned in a bit in order to bring out the true beauty you were trying to capture (and, unfortunately, that is something that you can''t really do under basic editing rules).  as a challenge entry, this is somewhat lacking in that there is not much context to relate it to ''early early in the morning''.  if this doesn''t do as well as you would like, don''t give up; just keep on trying and learning, and you''ll get where you want to go.</td>', 'as an image, this spot might have some potential, but the water is not that appealling at the moment.  the blown out area needs to be reigned in a bit in order to bring out the true beauty you were trying to capture (and, unfortunately, that is something that you can''t really do under basic editing rules).  as a challenge entry, this is somewhat lacking in that there is not much context to relate it to ''early early in the morning''.  if this doesn''t do as well as you would like, don''t give up; just keep on trying and learning, and you''ll get where you want to go.', '2005-12-15 10:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
