(1953983, 268624, 32644, '<td valign="top">Too funny. The back arm blends too much with the tree in the background, IMHO.</td>', 'Too funny. The back arm blends too much with the tree in the background, IMHO.', '2005-12-15 12:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1953985, 268985, 9253, '<td valign="top">Great! Loved it. Hope you win a ribbon.</td>', 'Great! Loved it. Hope you win a ribbon.', '2005-12-15 12:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1953987, 268883, 9253, '<td valign="top">Great sho and good timing. Hope you win a ribbon</td>', 'Great sho and good timing. Hope you win a ribbon', '2005-12-15 12:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1954049, 268984, 38930, '<td valign="top">She''s proooobably going to hate you when she finds this for millions to see on the internet!! =)</td>', 'She''s proooobably going to hate you when she finds this for millions to see on the internet!! =)', '2005-12-15 13:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1954105, 266285, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice, very clean image.</td>', 'Nice, very clean image.', '2005-12-15 13:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1954107, 268985, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I love the colours.</td>', 'Very nice, I love the colours.', '2005-12-15 13:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1954109, 266724, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice and the sparkles are a great touch.</td>', 'Very nice and the sparkles are a great touch.', '2005-12-15 13:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1954110, 267750, 43774, '<td valign="top">Cute, I would prefer it if he were looking at the present instead of the camera.</td>', 'Cute, I would prefer it if he were looking at the present instead of the camera.', '2005-12-15 13:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1954114, 268032, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice except the spot over the tallest candle is really distracting. I would have removed the curtain in the upper left hand corner too.</td>', 'Very nice except the spot over the tallest candle is really distracting. I would have removed the curtain in the upper left hand corner too.', '2005-12-15 13:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1954191, 267110, 49655, '<td valign="top">I like this one very much! The colors are great. Is the moonlight on the house roof?</td>', 'I like this one very much! The colors are great. Is the moonlight on the house roof?', '2005-12-15 14:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1954200, 268321, 49655, '<td valign="top">Nice picture! The glance of the boy is disquieting</td>', 'Nice picture! The glance of the boy is disquieting', '2005-12-15 14:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1954223, 267024, 23430, '<td valign="top">Good humour that most of us can probably relate to. Good lighting and tones and great title. Well done.</td>', 'Good humour that most of us can probably relate to. Good lighting and tones and great title. Well done.', '2005-12-15 14:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1954230, 269016, 23430, '<td valign="top">Good tones and lighting. Good crop/space around you.</td>', 'Good tones and lighting. Good crop/space around you.', '2005-12-15 14:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1954233, 268309, 23430, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast of these colours against the blackness. Nice balance of light to dark.</td>', 'Nice contrast of these colours against the blackness. Nice balance of light to dark.', '2005-12-15 14:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1954243, 266940, 23430, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge well. Good angle and I like how you only used the light from the fridge.</td>', 'Meets the challenge well. Good angle and I like how you only used the light from the fridge.', '2005-12-15 14:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1954254, 267723, 23430, '<td valign="top">Obviously meets the challenge. May have been improved by cropping out the lights below and moving the sign off centre.</td>', 'Obviously meets the challenge. May have been improved by cropping out the lights below and moving the sign off centre.', '2005-12-15 14:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1954259, 268696, 23430, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and framing of the fish. I think more light from the top to light up the top of the fish and it''s face would have improved this shot more.</td>', 'Nice colours and framing of the fish. I think more light from the top to light up the top of the fish and it''s face would have improved this shot more.', '2005-12-15 14:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1954262, 267830, 23430, '<td valign="top">Good lighting to leave all the surrounding black</td>', 'Good lighting to leave all the surrounding black', '2005-12-15 14:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1954268, 268856, 49655, '<td valign="top">Nice baby face, but totally blurred and out of focus</td>', 'Nice baby face, but totally blurred and out of focus', '2005-12-15 14:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1954270, 268640, 23430, '<td valign="top">Simple and clever. This is too real I don''t think it''s even a setup. Good lighting and I love the expression. Well done.</td>', 'Simple and clever. This is too real I don''t think it''s even a setup. Good lighting and I love the expression. Well done.', '2005-12-15 14:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1954272, 267024, 49655, '<td valign="top">I try to imagine this picture with black background, could be better. Anyway it''s a good shot.</td>', 'I try to imagine this picture with black background, could be better. Anyway it''s a good shot.', '2005-12-15 14:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1954326, 267830, 41411, '<td valign="top">I just plain don''t like it. What difference does it make if you take a picture of a lego technic car at 4 AM or at noon? It''s still a lego car. Legos are sweet as hell, but most photographs of legos look like lego advertisements. Theyre good to play with, not to photograph.</td>', 'I just plain don''t like it. What difference does it make if you take a picture of a lego technic car at 4 AM or at noon? It''s still a lego car. Legos are sweet as hell, but most photographs of legos look like lego advertisements. Theyre good to play with, not to photograph.', '2005-12-15 15:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1954331, 267024, 41411, '<td valign="top">"sex sells"<br/> <br/>the man''s naked torso detracts from the focus of the photograph, the coffee pot. <br/>plus, it''s not light out at 4 or 5 AM, and that lighting suggests light coming through a window. also, the isolated subject thing isn''t a good thing, it makes it look unnatural and commercial, and this shot would be a lot better in the context of a kitchen or something.</td>', '"sex sells" the man''s naked torso detracts from the focus of the photograph, the coffee pot. plus, it''s not light out at 4 or 5 AM, and that lighting suggests light coming through a window. also, the isolated subject thing isn''t a good thing, it makes it look unnatural and commercial, and this shot would be a lot better in the context of a kitchen or something.', '2005-12-15 15:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1954333, 267503, 41411, '<td valign="top">FAKED EXPRESSION = LAME<br/> <br/>EVERYONE DID A COFFEE SHOT</td>', 'FAKED EXPRESSION = LAME EVERYONE DID A COFFEE SHOT', '2005-12-15 15:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1954336, 267254, 41411, '<td valign="top">I don''t find this terribly clever. Why Bacardi? Do you work in the marketing department of Bacardi? Also, the light that bottle creates behind the clock kind of ruins the drama of the shot.</td>', 'I don''t find this terribly clever. Why Bacardi? Do you work in the marketing department of Bacardi? Also, the light that bottle creates behind the clock kind of ruins the drama of the shot.', '2005-12-15 15:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1954340, 266868, 41411, '<td valign="top">It''s nice, but it''s too symmetrical and there''s nothing in particular to look at, making it rather uninteresting. Symmetry can be boring...</td>', 'It''s nice, but it''s too symmetrical and there''s nothing in particular to look at, making it rather uninteresting. Symmetry can be boring...', '2005-12-15 15:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1954343, 268490, 41411, '<td valign="top">I think your title should''ve been something like "early morning rush to a place i loathe too much: five days a week, fifty weeks a year, work work work" <br/> <br/>i wish it weren''t grainy, you ought to have experimented more with driving shots. they turn out well if you put the dash in frame, and you time the shot for when a car''s passing you or some such thing.</td>', 'I think your title should''ve been something like "early morning rush to a place i loathe too much: five days a week, fifty weeks a year, work work work"  i wish it weren''t grainy, you ought to have experimented more with driving shots. they turn out well if you put the dash in frame, and you time the shot for when a car''s passing you or some such thing.', '2005-12-15 15:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1954345, 268889, 41411, '<td valign="top">You should''ve gotten a shot without that huge stick for the snowmaker on the right side. the chairs, trees, and sky are fantastic together, but that big stick in the foreground on the right side is extremely distracting, and adds nothing. 5</td>', 'You should''ve gotten a shot without that huge stick for the snowmaker on the right side. the chairs, trees, and sky are fantastic together, but that big stick in the foreground on the right side is extremely distracting, and adds nothing. 5', '2005-12-15 15:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1954350, 268694, 41411, '<td valign="top">Yeah, I can appreciate no-smoking laws though. If you can''t smoke in the comfort of public indoor space, you may be less likely to smoke. It certainly has kept me from becoming addicted, since I only smoke while drunk and outside, whereas if i could smoke indoors while drunk I''d probably smoke a lot more. I really like orange shots, you shouldve cropped out more of the left side, i don''t like that bright spot on the left.</td>', 'Yeah, I can appreciate no-smoking laws though. If you can''t smoke in the comfort of public indoor space, you may be less likely to smoke. It certainly has kept me from becoming addicted, since I only smoke while drunk and outside, whereas if i could smoke indoors while drunk I''d probably smoke a lot more. I really like orange shots, you shouldve cropped out more of the left side, i don''t like that bright spot on the left.', '2005-12-15 15:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1954351, 267123, 41411, '<td valign="top">I like that silhouette. You shouldve cropped off the leftmost car. Go photojournalism.</td>', 'I like that silhouette. You shouldve cropped off the leftmost car. Go photojournalism.', '2005-12-15 15:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1954352, 268877, 41411, '<td valign="top">This has no significance to 4 or 5 AM. Could''ve been taken anytime during the night. Plus, christmas lights are only so interesting as a subject.</td>', 'This has no significance to 4 or 5 AM. Could''ve been taken anytime during the night. Plus, christmas lights are only so interesting as a subject.', '2005-12-15 15:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1954355, 268057, 41411, '<td valign="top">I like it. It''s confusing, it''s hazy, the light''s too harsh, you don''t know what''s going on. Kind of like an early morning. I''m giving you a ten, because I know people will be jerks and give you low votes.</td>', 'I like it. It''s confusing, it''s hazy, the light''s too harsh, you don''t know what''s going on. Kind of like an early morning. I''m giving you a ten, because I know people will be jerks and give you low votes.', '2005-12-15 15:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1954358, 268467, 41411, '<td valign="top">I like it a lot. His leg shouldn''t be up though, and he should look more sailoresque. But hell, you probably didn''t want to spend a whole lot of time on the shot - it''s too much work to find a damned sailor outfit. I relaly like it. If I were a sailor this would be nostalgia. EIGHT because I''m real nice</td>', 'I like it a lot. His leg shouldn''t be up though, and he should look more sailoresque. But hell, you probably didn''t want to spend a whole lot of time on the shot - it''s too much work to find a damned sailor outfit. I relaly like it. If I were a sailor this would be nostalgia. EIGHT because I''m real nice', '2005-12-15 15:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1954359, 268848, 41411, '<td valign="top">it looks like you made the contrast negative. It looks like you took this during the middle of the day... it''s bright out.... ITS SO PLAIN, where are the colors, where is the contrast.</td>', 'it looks like you made the contrast negative. It looks like you took this during the middle of the day... it''s bright out.... ITS SO PLAIN, where are the colors, where is the contrast.', '2005-12-15 15:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1954361, 268855, 41411, '<td valign="top">It''s too straightforward and sleek/sleazy for my liking. It''s blank art. But it does look sharp. I think it merits a three because I am a terrible person.</td>', 'It''s too straightforward and sleek/sleazy for my liking. It''s blank art. But it does look sharp. I think it merits a three because I am a terrible person.', '2005-12-15 15:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1954364, 267110, 41411, '<td valign="top">it''s a bit underexposed... just a touch. I know you wanted it to look dark, but i think some more detail of the reflection on the pond would be killer. The sky looks real nice, and the image certainly fits the title.</td>', 'it''s a bit underexposed... just a touch. I know you wanted it to look dark, but i think some more detail of the reflection on the pond would be killer. The sky looks real nice, and the image certainly fits the title.', '2005-12-15 15:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
