(1955596, 267110, 30861, '<td valign="top">This image, IMO, is far and away the best of the entries. The oevrall sense of deep &amp; tranquil pre-dawn hours is almost overwhelming. Technically is is exceptionally good.  If this does not take the blue, there''s no justice in DPC :-)</td>', 'This image, IMO, is far and away the best of the entries. The oevrall sense of deep & tranquil pre-dawn hours is almost overwhelming. Technically is is exceptionally good.  If this does not take the blue, there''s no justice in DPC :-)', '2005-12-16 01:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1955599, 268757, 41904, '<td valign="top">Haha, both of you? That''s something! I have to tell my girlfriend about that!</td>', 'Haha, both of you? That''s something! I have to tell my girlfriend about that!', '2005-12-16 01:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1955600, 268693, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is a haunting image, well-dersving of a high place in the challenge. I wish it were sharper, but I presume it was handheld at a slow shutter speed and i can overlook this imperfection.</td>', 'This is a haunting image, well-dersving of a high place in the challenge. I wish it were sharper, but I presume it was handheld at a slow shutter speed and i can overlook this imperfection.', '2005-12-16 01:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
