(1955679, 266569, 49082, '<td valign="top">I think the snow is such a cute addition! Soooo romantic!<br/> <br/>&lt;3 Sarah<br/> <br/>P.S. DEFINITELY MY FAVORITE! I am such a sap.  Plus I am just in love with the technique of actually leaving the snowflakes there (though I don''t know how you''d make them go away) and I absolutely love the detail of the Christmas lights in the background on the house. That is just so sweet and so romantic. May have been cute vertical though! Just a thought for next time to really focus on that couple!!! This is one of those pictures where focusing on the main object is really important because there is so much else crowding it. The snow is lovely btw...I''ve never seen real snow in real life lol</td>', 'I think the snow is such a cute addition! Soooo romantic! <3 Sarah P.S. DEFINITELY MY FAVORITE! I am such a sap.  Plus I am just in love with the technique of actually leaving the snowflakes there (though I don''t know how you''d make them go away) and I absolutely love the detail of the Christmas lights in the background on the house. That is just so sweet and so romantic. May have been cute vertical though! Just a thought for next time to really focus on that couple!!! This is one of those pictures where focusing on the main object is really important because there is so much else crowding it. The snow is lovely btw...I''ve never seen real snow in real life lol', '2005-12-16 02:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
