(1958181, 268709, 46119, '<td valign="top">Fantastic detail here!</td>', 'Fantastic detail here!', '2005-12-17 12:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958263, 267110, 18197, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo. I like the colors very much. Placement of the horizon and the house in the frame show a very good sense of design and balance. The direction of the camera relative to the rising sun does a nice job catching the dawn''s gradient sky. I also like that you caught some stars ... they add a sense of scale to the photo that would be missing otherwise. In short, beautiful setting, beautiful time of day, beautifully captured. I expect it to ribbon.</td>', 'Beautiful photo. I like the colors very much. Placement of the horizon and the house in the frame show a very good sense of design and balance. The direction of the camera relative to the rising sun does a nice job catching the dawn''s gradient sky. I also like that you caught some stars ... they add a sense of scale to the photo that would be missing otherwise. In short, beautiful setting, beautiful time of day, beautifully captured. I expect it to ribbon.', '2005-12-17 13:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958269, 268640, 18197, '<td valign="top">This does a nice job conveying the emotion implied by the title. Well composed and leveled. It might be a bit oversharpened, at least to my taste, but the sharpening is effective at capturing the texture of the face. If advanced editing were available, I might have cloned out a few hot pixels, but they don''t distract very much at all. Nicely done!</td>', 'This does a nice job conveying the emotion implied by the title. Well composed and leveled. It might be a bit oversharpened, at least to my taste, but the sharpening is effective at capturing the texture of the face. If advanced editing were available, I might have cloned out a few hot pixels, but they don''t distract very much at all. Nicely done!', '2005-12-17 13:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958272, 268728, 18197, '<td valign="top">Without the title, I would not have been able to figure out what was being photographed. This is a matter of personal taste, but for me, I need something for my eye to rest on and I can''t find anything here.</td>', 'Without the title, I would not have been able to figure out what was being photographed. This is a matter of personal taste, but for me, I need something for my eye to rest on and I can''t find anything here.', '2005-12-17 13:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958281, 267236, 18197, '<td valign="top">The dark area around the screen hints at details that might be there, but it is so dark, I can''t make any of them out. My monitor is calibrated by the way.  If I copy and paste the image into Photoshop, it brightens up somewhat. I am wondering if you saved the image in a color space other than sRGB (possibly B&amp;W or Grayscale) which might account for it when it''s displayed in my IE6 browser.</td>', 'The dark area around the screen hints at details that might be there, but it is so dark, I can''t make any of them out. My monitor is calibrated by the way.  If I copy and paste the image into Photoshop, it brightens up somewhat. I am wondering if you saved the image in a color space other than sRGB (possibly B&W or Grayscale) which might account for it when it''s displayed in my IE6 browser.', '2005-12-17 13:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958290, 267503, 18197, '<td valign="top">Except for the flash, which seems a bit harsh to me, this is a good workmanlike image. Concept is good but the subject just doesn''t hold my interest.</td>', 'Except for the flash, which seems a bit harsh to me, this is a good workmanlike image. Concept is good but the subject just doesn''t hold my interest.', '2005-12-17 13:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958297, 268915, 18197, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t hold my interest. It is a common enough experience that folks can resonate with it, but when you take a photo of something common, you need something uncommon in the image to hold people''s eye.</td>', 'This doesn''t hold my interest. It is a common enough experience that folks can resonate with it, but when you take a photo of something common, you need something uncommon in the image to hold people''s eye.', '2005-12-17 13:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958298, 268598, 18197, '<td valign="top">I think I see the effect you''re going for here, but to my taste, the post processing feels too severe.</td>', 'I think I see the effect you''re going for here, but to my taste, the post processing feels too severe.', '2005-12-17 13:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958304, 267071, 18197, '<td valign="top">I would encourage you to upload larger images. Make your longest dimension the full 640 pixels allowed (instead of the 260 in this case). This will let folks see the details in the photo which will help them appreciate it better.</td>', 'I would encourage you to upload larger images. Make your longest dimension the full 640 pixels allowed (instead of the 260 in this case). This will let folks see the details in the photo which will help them appreciate it better.', '2005-12-17 13:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958307, 268416, 18197, '<td valign="top">This may have been taken between 4:00 and 5:00 AM but there is nothing in the photo that relates to the spirit of the challenge.</td>', 'This may have been taken between 4:00 and 5:00 AM but there is nothing in the photo that relates to the spirit of the challenge.', '2005-12-17 13:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958316, 269022, 18197, '<td valign="top">Interesting and unusual clock but, to my taste, not a very interesting or unusual image. Doesn''t hold my attention.</td>', 'Interesting and unusual clock but, to my taste, not a very interesting or unusual image. Doesn''t hold my attention.', '2005-12-17 13:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958333, 268671, 18197, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked at this photo a few times and tried to like it because I can see myself attempting a similar shot. I think this might have appealed to me more if I could see a hint of detail in the black background. The ornament on the left is very difficult to photograph. There is so much going on, light, reflection, angles, sharp and soft ... that it all runs together for me and my eye can''t find a place to rest except the dark, but there''s nothing there to hold my interest.</td>', 'I''ve looked at this photo a few times and tried to like it because I can see myself attempting a similar shot. I think this might have appealed to me more if I could see a hint of detail in the black background. The ornament on the left is very difficult to photograph. There is so much going on, light, reflection, angles, sharp and soft ... that it all runs together for me and my eye can''t find a place to rest except the dark, but there''s nothing there to hold my interest.', '2005-12-17 13:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958340, 268478, 42005, '<td valign="top">Quite delightful.</td>', 'Quite delightful.', '2005-12-17 13:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958344, 268839, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very difficult subject with a conventional lens. If you don''t have access to a telescope, but are shooting with a DSLR, try putting a teleconverter between your lens and your camera. To my taste, it either needs to be razor sharp, or the frame needs to include something of interest so the moon is only adding context.</td>', 'Very difficult subject with a conventional lens. If you don''t have access to a telescope, but are shooting with a DSLR, try putting a teleconverter between your lens and your camera. To my taste, it either needs to be razor sharp, or the frame needs to include something of interest so the moon is only adding context.', '2005-12-17 13:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958345, 268321, 42005, '<td valign="top">Evokes emotion, that is for certain.</td>', 'Evokes emotion, that is for certain.', '2005-12-17 13:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958350, 269016, 42005, '<td valign="top">Extremely crisp.  Great light.</td>', 'Extremely crisp.  Great light.', '2005-12-17 13:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
