(1958644, 267897, 49763, '<td valign="top">I like this picture. That''s such an early hour to be at work. I''m glad I don''t work at a bakery. I especially like the subject located to the right with the impeccabel style. Good. 8</td>', 'I like this picture. That''s such an early hour to be at work. I''m glad I don''t work at a bakery. I especially like the subject located to the right with the impeccabel style. Good. 8', '2005-12-17 16:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958647, 268248, 49763, '<td valign="top">I really like the early morning light in this photo. The subject seems more a result of violence than a sleepwalker. The pillow does suggest your title. Good. 8</td>', 'I really like the early morning light in this photo. The subject seems more a result of violence than a sleepwalker. The pillow does suggest your title. Good. 8', '2005-12-17 16:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958651, 268309, 49763, '<td valign="top">Pitch dark at four. It seems you don''t live in the lower latitudes. The blue light is big enough and in good focus to make this a good picture. 8</td>', 'Pitch dark at four. It seems you don''t live in the lower latitudes. The blue light is big enough and in good focus to make this a good picture. 8', '2005-12-17 16:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958655, 268889, 49763, '<td valign="top">An excellent picture. I admire your capture of the sky. This reminds me of good times on trains full of teens climbing through the dark to the snowy mountains. I appreciate the feeling this picture invokes. 9</td>', 'An excellent picture. I admire your capture of the sky. This reminds me of good times on trains full of teens climbing through the dark to the snowy mountains. I appreciate the feeling this picture invokes. 9', '2005-12-17 16:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958661, 268624, 49763, '<td valign="top">That stone face is priceless. This makes me think of the statue they have in the crashing waves in Australia. An excellent subject to choose. 9</td>', 'That stone face is priceless. This makes me think of the statue they have in the crashing waves in Australia. An excellent subject to choose. 9', '2005-12-17 16:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958664, 267723, 49763, '<td valign="top">Who wants to do there banking at 4:21 in the morning? The numbers make me think of those T-shirts that said "4:21 Just did it." with a Nike symbol, smoke drifting out.</td>', 'Who wants to do there banking at 4:21 in the morning? The numbers make me think of those T-shirts that said "4:21 Just did it." with a Nike symbol, smoke drifting out.', '2005-12-17 16:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958677, 266847, 23394, '<td valign="top">there is nothing particularly engaging about this image.  the subject looks like she could make for some interesting images, and the lighting looks like it has loads of potential.  however, what you''ve captured here is more of a bad snapshot than anything else.  as for the challenge, other than her looking a bit disheveled, there''s nothing that really says early in the morning to me.</td>', 'there is nothing particularly engaging about this image.  the subject looks like she could make for some interesting images, and the lighting looks like it has loads of potential.  however, what you''ve captured here is more of a bad snapshot than anything else.  as for the challenge, other than her looking a bit disheveled, there''s nothing that really says early in the morning to me.', '2005-12-17 16:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958682, 269016, 23394, '<td valign="top">sorry, but this just doesn''t get it for me.  as an image, it''s all right, as a challenge entry, it doesn''t really grab me, either.  might make for an interesting series of prints, though.</td>', 'sorry, but this just doesn''t get it for me.  as an image, it''s all right, as a challenge entry, it doesn''t really grab me, either.  might make for an interesting series of prints, though.', '2005-12-17 17:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958684, 269004, 49763, '<td valign="top">Was not this the name of another challenge? The low contrast light is beautiful. 9</td>', 'Was not this the name of another challenge? The low contrast light is beautiful. 9', '2005-12-17 17:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958687, 268860, 49763, '<td valign="top">This picture has a California feel to it with the pink and palm. I really like it. 8</td>', 'This picture has a California feel to it with the pink and palm. I really like it. 8', '2005-12-17 17:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958688, 267135, 23394, '<td valign="top">as much as i can appreciate the effort/desire here, the execution isn''t quite where it needs to be.  you might consider spending some time in the archives looking for the images that really grab you, then spend some time out trying to recreate them.  the more you practice, the closer you''ll get.  as much as anything, you need to work on composition, especially in deciding what to include and what to exclude from your image. check out this image<br/>[thumb]155486[/thumb]</td>', 'as much as i can appreciate the effort/desire here, the execution isn''t quite where it needs to be.  you might consider spending some time in the archives looking for the images that really grab you, then spend some time out trying to recreate them.  the more you practice, the closer you''ll get.  as much as anything, you need to work on composition, especially in deciding what to include and what to exclude from your image. check out this image[thumb]155486[/thumb]', '2005-12-17 17:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958695, 266545, 49763, '<td valign="top">The eye is very fierce and striking. It makes this a powerful shot. I assume it was taken between four and five ante merdiem. 9</td>', 'The eye is very fierce and striking. It makes this a powerful shot. I assume it was taken between four and five ante merdiem. 9', '2005-12-17 17:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
