(1958726, 267997, 44963, '<td valign="top">The lighting and the movement in this image appealed to me.  You have captured a very ''mystical'' moment - even if it only a creek and a street light.  Looks fantastic.</td>', 'The lighting and the movement in this image appealed to me.  You have captured a very ''mystical'' moment - even if it only a creek and a street light.  Looks fantastic.', '2005-12-17 17:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
