(1958751, 268984, 49763, '<td valign="top">I don''t blame your subject for still sleeping at that hour. She looks very comfortable. I am interested in all the colour and patterns found in this bed. 8</td>', 'I don''t blame your subject for still sleeping at that hour. She looks very comfortable. I am interested in all the colour and patterns found in this bed. 8', '2005-12-17 17:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
