(1958759, 268899, 49763, '<td valign="top">A morning jog on the shoreline. This is a very blue picture. Blue is a cold colour and conveys the temperature of this scene very well. 8</td>', 'A morning jog on the shoreline. This is a very blue picture. Blue is a cold colour and conveys the temperature of this scene very well. 8', '2005-12-17 17:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
