(1958783, 267723, 21894, '<td valign="top">lol you took the photo to show that you got up 4:21 but the photo has no composition in it....  its just centerd and its not saying much.... to the veiwer or the seller... (just saying if i was buyinh it) but nice effort</td>', 'lol you took the photo to show that you got up 4:21 but the photo has no composition in it....  its just centerd and its not saying much.... to the veiwer or the seller... (just saying if i was buyinh it) but nice effort', '2005-12-17 17:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958785, 268693, 49763, '<td valign="top">After the mine colapsed and the value of raw minerals feel the seven dwarves feel on hard times. Seriously though, I have seen many of this street sleepers in most of the cities I have visited or lived in. I, myself, have tried sleeping on cardboard in some of the homeless dens of the world but found the smell of feces unbearable.</td>', 'After the mine colapsed and the value of raw minerals feel the seven dwarves feel on hard times. Seriously though, I have seen many of this street sleepers in most of the cities I have visited or lived in. I, myself, have tried sleeping on cardboard in some of the homeless dens of the world but found the smell of feces unbearable.', '2005-12-17 17:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958788, 267123, 21894, '<td valign="top">i like the crime scene event.... if it was sharper or if you add a different composition or at a different angle this picture would make it in the top ten...<br/>good job and i gave you a nice grade for your effort</td>', 'i like the crime scene event.... if it was sharper or if you add a different composition or at a different angle this picture would make it in the top ten...good job and i gave you a nice grade for your effort', '2005-12-17 17:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
