(1958795, 267024, 21894, '<td valign="top">good composition.... creativity is there  the overall picture is gray... i need to see the true blacks and white.... he look like he was just posing to take the picture.. he needs to put just a little more expression as how He would really get up early in the morning to go to work....<br/>Good Job....</td>', 'good composition.... creativity is there  the overall picture is gray... i need to see the true blacks and white.... he look like he was just posing to take the picture.. he needs to put just a little more expression as how He would really get up early in the morning to go to work....Good Job....', '2005-12-17 17:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958803, 266940, 49763, '<td valign="top">The headless leftover hunter. I only yhink of those that are instead cooking breakfast at such an hour. Preparing for a day at the factory. I like your excellent composition. 9</td>', 'The headless leftover hunter. I only yhink of those that are instead cooking breakfast at such an hour. Preparing for a day at the factory. I like your excellent composition. 9', '2005-12-17 17:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958810, 267900, 49763, '<td valign="top">I have heard that photography of the moon is better with a half moon as the contrast is better on the surface. I see now that that is true. A moving shot. 10</td>', 'I have heard that photography of the moon is better with a half moon as the contrast is better on the surface. I see now that that is true. A moving shot. 10', '2005-12-17 17:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
