(1958815, 269021, 21894, '<td valign="top">this shot look like it was taken around 6 7 am. how i know if its true... check your light pole shadows.... or maybe its because you converted it to black and white image. the idea is interesting but the model did a not so good job i dont know if its a rat or garbage... the position of the car is nice but if i was driving 5 am in the morning my lights need to be on.... a black and white pic i need to see true blacks and true white otherwise its not black and white... the dodgeing that you did is too much there... thats the first thing i see in the picture and its distracting, you should allow it to come from the side or everywhere then make it go up in the air as if hes going to heaven and make it more dramatic....<br/>the idea is nice the work needs a lot touching up<br/>i gave you a good grade</td>', 'this shot look like it was taken around 6 7 am. how i know if its true... check your light pole shadows.... or maybe its because you converted it to black and white image. the idea is interesting but the model did a not so good job i dont know if its a rat or garbage... the position of the car is nice but if i was driving 5 am in the morning my lights need to be on.... a black and white pic i need to see true blacks and true white otherwise its not black and white... the dodgeing that you did is too much there... thats the first thing i see in the picture and its distracting, you should allow it to come from the side or everywhere then make it go up in the air as if hes going to heaven and make it more dramatic....the idea is nice the work needs a lot touching upi gave you a good grade', '2005-12-17 17:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958816, 269009, 49763, '<td valign="top">A lovely composition and sense of movement in your photo. The river is near frozen I imagine. The clours are what make this picture compelete. 9</td>', 'A lovely composition and sense of movement in your photo. The river is near frozen I imagine. The clours are what make this picture compelete. 9', '2005-12-17 17:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958821, 268690, 21894, '<td valign="top">i like the idea.. and the composition is there... but the thing thats going to make your photograph get a fair grade is the overall picture..... your lighting is low and i cannot see a true black and white photograph....<br/>nice job, and i gave you a good grade</td>', 'i like the idea.. and the composition is there... but the thing thats going to make your photograph get a fair grade is the overall picture..... your lighting is low and i cannot see a true black and white photograph....nice job, and i gave you a good grade', '2005-12-17 18:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
