(1958830, 267687, 21894, '<td valign="top">i like the photograph.. but the thing is to make this picture look like you took it in the morning you should wait till i can see the sun... or you could have it on long exposure and have a till you see the sun comes up and you would have an wonderful effect..... also the way you took the image should be like a panorama it should be horizontal and full your frame up.. when i see this pic you want it to make me feel as is im there, or want to be there, or just one word wow!<br/> <br/>good job.... fair grade</td>', 'i like the photograph.. but the thing is to make this picture look like you took it in the morning you should wait till i can see the sun... or you could have it on long exposure and have a till you see the sun comes up and you would have an wonderful effect..... also the way you took the image should be like a panorama it should be horizontal and full your frame up.. when i see this pic you want it to make me feel as is im there, or want to be there, or just one word wow! good job.... fair grade', '2005-12-17 18:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
