(1960563, 268936, 47956, '<td valign="top">Sunrise doesn''t happen in Sydney until about 5.37am, even civil twilight doesn''t happen until after 5.00am. Great shot and worth a 10 but doesn''t really fit the challenge, so 5 only.</td>', 'Sunrise doesn''t happen in Sydney until about 5.37am, even civil twilight doesn''t happen until after 5.00am. Great shot and worth a 10 but doesn''t really fit the challenge, so 5 only.', '2005-12-18 18:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
