(1961755, 268842, 49763, '<td valign="top">One of the best reflection compositions I have seen in months. I say this due to the clarity of all the levels of this picture. A highlight of this picture are the cuves visible in the distant mountain. 10</td>', 'One of the best reflection compositions I have seen in months. I say this due to the clarity of all the levels of this picture. A highlight of this picture are the cuves visible in the distant mountain. 10', '2005-12-19 01:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961758, 268630, 49763, '<td valign="top">An especially nice macro shot when considred in conjuncture with the title and the challenge. The half awake eye is a compelling subject. Very nice and crisp image. 9</td>', 'An especially nice macro shot when considred in conjuncture with the title and the challenge. The half awake eye is a compelling subject. Very nice and crisp image. 9', '2005-12-19 01:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961761, 267576, 49763, '<td valign="top">A breath taking back drop to this intriguing subject. The graffiti is especially effective for me as it is such a focus of this image. Good stuff.</td>', 'A breath taking back drop to this intriguing subject. The graffiti is especially effective for me as it is such a focus of this image. Good stuff.', '2005-12-19 01:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961920, 266847, 39221, '<td valign="top">schwing!</td>', 'schwing!', '2005-12-19 03:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1962061, 268877, 18080, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but it looks like there is a bit of camera shake.<br/> <br/>Good luck</td>', 'Great idea, but it looks like there is a bit of camera shake. Good luck', '2005-12-19 07:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1962064, 268974, 18080, '<td valign="top">Love the grain in this shot. Very emotional. Pity it looks like she is wearing socks or shoes&gt;<br/>Good luck<br/>8<br/> <br/>Kev</td>', 'Love the grain in this shot. Very emotional. Pity it looks like she is wearing socks or shoes>Good luck8 Kev', '2005-12-19 07:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1962111, 268883, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool but the overexposed moon isn´t very good looking.  I know this is an almost impossible image to make within the basic editing rules but I would have liked this shot much better with the silhouette of the bird, the sky slightly brighter but still moody and the moon correctly exposed.  Still very nice, I gave it a 6.</td>', 'Pretty cool but the overexposed moon isn´t very good looking.  I know this is an almost impossible image to make within the basic editing rules but I would have liked this shot much better with the silhouette of the bird, the sky slightly brighter but still moody and the moon correctly exposed.  Still very nice, I gave it a 6.', '2005-12-19 08:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1962115, 268936, 26633, '<td valign="top">My favourite in the whole challenge. The silhouettes are just right, subtle enough so the scne isn''t blocked up with black but solid enough to contrast with the sky and the rising sun. This could hang on the wall of the yacht club quite happily!</td>', 'My favourite in the whole challenge. The silhouettes are just right, subtle enough so the scne isn''t blocked up with black but solid enough to contrast with the sky and the rising sun. This could hang on the wall of the yacht club quite happily!', '2005-12-19 08:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1962120, 267035, 26633, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, subtle serene, need I go on? The placement of the cloud above the tree is perfect, I think it adds to the serenity of the scene, some people would like it over on the right to balance the tree. Bumped up to 9.</td>', 'Beautiful, subtle serene, need I go on? The placement of the cloud above the tree is perfect, I think it adds to the serenity of the scene, some people would like it over on the right to balance the tree. Bumped up to 9.', '2005-12-19 08:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1962123, 268348, 26633, '<td valign="top">I still don''t know what to think about this one. It has a strange "Restaurant at the End of the Universe" feel to it. The colours, composition and "smoky" water look great. So, 9 from me.</td>', 'I still don''t know what to think about this one. It has a strange "Restaurant at the End of the Universe" feel to it. The colours, composition and "smoky" water look great. So, 9 from me.', '2005-12-19 08:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1962125, 268712, 26633, '<td valign="top">I really want to know where this is, it is the sort of place I could stand for hours, especially on a morning like that. I gave this an 8, maybe a little more detail or a different crop would have squeezed an extra point or two from me, but it''s your picture, not mine ;)</td>', 'I really want to know where this is, it is the sort of place I could stand for hours, especially on a morning like that. I gave this an 8, maybe a little more detail or a different crop would have squeezed an extra point or two from me, but it''s your picture, not mine ;)', '2005-12-19 08:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1962126, 266847, 26633, '<td valign="top">A stunning low light portrait. Great lighting on the hair, love the pose and the cuff detail. 9</td>', 'A stunning low light portrait. Great lighting on the hair, love the pose and the cuff detail. 9', '2005-12-19 08:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1962136, 268490, 26633, '<td valign="top">These can be really tough pictures to get right, but this one is excellent. There''s plenty going on, the colours are great and the noise is well controlled. 8</td>', 'These can be really tough pictures to get right, but this one is excellent. There''s plenty going on, the colours are great and the noise is well controlled. 8', '2005-12-19 08:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1962146, 268883, 26633, '<td valign="top">Looks like this belongs on the cover of a vampire novel! Very effective. My personal opinion is that the left side of the picture isn''t contributing anything and that the picture works well as a vertical. 8</td>', 'Looks like this belongs on the cover of a vampire novel! Very effective. My personal opinion is that the left side of the picture isn''t contributing anything and that the picture works well as a vertical. 8', '2005-12-19 08:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1962149, 268623, 26633, '<td valign="top">Creepy and mysterious. The "soot and whitewash" treatment is great, the grain/noise just enough and the movement of the stooping person makes the viewer ask questions. Bumping up to a 9.</td>', 'Creepy and mysterious. The "soot and whitewash" treatment is great, the grain/noise just enough and the movement of the stooping person makes the viewer ask questions. Bumping up to a 9.', '2005-12-19 08:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1962193, 268751, 43405, '<td valign="top">And...... Was it the last one, or did you end up with a blue eye?</td>', 'And...... Was it the last one, or did you end up with a blue eye?', '2005-12-19 09:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1962195, 267110, 43405, '<td valign="top">I really liked this one, my only 10 so far. Colour is great.</td>', 'I really liked this one, my only 10 so far. Colour is great.', '2005-12-19 09:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1962458, 266847, 49033, '<td valign="top">I really like this one, and not just the girl is beautiful.  She looks a little hung-over, almost like she was out  all night long partying. It''s a little washed out, but overall very nice.</td>', 'I really like this one, and not just the girl is beautiful.  She looks a little hung-over, almost like she was out  all night long partying. It''s a little washed out, but overall very nice.', '2005-12-19 11:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1962468, 268877, 49033, '<td valign="top">Would have been nice but a little too blurry.</td>', 'Would have been nice but a little too blurry.', '2005-12-19 11:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1962491, 266867, 49033, '<td valign="top">I like the subject but the composition is a little off. Maybe straighten out and take a more 1/3 approach to it.</td>', 'I like the subject but the composition is a little off. Maybe straighten out and take a more 1/3 approach to it.', '2005-12-19 11:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1962494, 268623, 49033, '<td valign="top">Very nice,</td>', 'Very nice,', '2005-12-19 11:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1962496, 266868, 49033, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2005-12-19 11:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1962519, 266361, 49033, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.</td>', 'Very nice composition.', '2005-12-19 11:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1962618, 268839, 12578, '<td valign="top">No matter what focal length your lens is the ideal settings on your camera for lunar photography is:<br/> <br/>ISO 100<br/>F/8.0<br/>1/250 sec <br/> <br/>(If you can set these on what your using of course)<br/> <br/>With the focus being on the moon of course, Nice capture none the less of this early evening moon :0)</td>', 'No matter what focal length your lens is the ideal settings on your camera for lunar photography is: ISO 100F/8.01/250 sec  (If you can set these on what your using of course) With the focus being on the moon of course, Nice capture none the less of this early evening moon :0)', '2005-12-19 12:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1962622, 268876, 12578, '<td valign="top">Great take on the subject although perhaps might of been better shot with greater range in the DOF</td>', 'Great take on the subject although perhaps might of been better shot with greater range in the DOF', '2005-12-19 12:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1962630, 268975, 12578, '<td valign="top">Excellent peice of stock photography, good lighting and a fantastic expression on the guys face too. 9</td>', 'Excellent peice of stock photography, good lighting and a fantastic expression on the guys face too. 9', '2005-12-19 12:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1962654, 268709, 12578, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot, can''t wait to see what you used to get this!??!?!??! Guessing a 500mm lens with a teleconvertor wit a small sensor (x1.6) - possibly a digiscope... Good luck, oh and can''t suggest any improvements!!! 10</td>', 'Fantastic shot, can''t wait to see what you used to get this!??!?!??! Guessing a 500mm lens with a teleconvertor wit a small sensor (x1.6) - possibly a digiscope... Good luck, oh and can''t suggest any improvements!!! 10', '2005-12-19 12:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1962666, 267900, 12578, '<td valign="top">Looks pretty good to me... the settings I use to get lunar shots are:<br/> <br/>ISO 100<br/>F/8.0<br/>1/250 sec <br/> <br/>Only real dislike abot this is that if it were a fuil moon (where my eyes are taking me out of the picture) the whole moon would not fit in correctly. I would have preffered to be pulled back a little and the moon sat on one of the rule of thirds lines in the frame - personal prefernce though, good luck.</td>', 'Looks pretty good to me... the settings I use to get lunar shots are: ISO 100F/8.01/250 sec  Only real dislike abot this is that if it were a fuil moon (where my eyes are taking me out of the picture) the whole moon would not fit in correctly. I would have preffered to be pulled back a little and the moon sat on one of the rule of thirds lines in the frame - personal prefernce though, good luck.', '2005-12-19 12:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1962776, 266847, 38706, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a record cover but I cannot place it - maybe Johnny Cougar?  Nice colours.</td>', 'Reminds me of a record cover but I cannot place it - maybe Johnny Cougar?  Nice colours.', '2005-12-19 13:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1962777, 267110, 38706, '<td valign="top">Stunning - I love the sky where it changes from black to blue.  This is first on my voting list.</td>', 'Stunning - I love the sky where it changes from black to blue.  This is first on my voting list.', '2005-12-19 13:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1962785, 268467, 38706, '<td valign="top">Got a great classic type style to it.  Maybe a little too blown out just behind the bow of the ship but nice capture.</td>', 'Got a great classic type style to it.  Maybe a little too blown out just behind the bow of the ship but nice capture.', '2005-12-19 13:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
