(1964676, 267071, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interested to know why you liked this enough to enter it into a competition. The tiny image and datestamp are real no-nos here IMO.</td>', 'Interested to know why you liked this enough to enter it into a competition. The tiny image and datestamp are real no-nos here IMO.', '2005-12-20 09:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1964680, 267686, 8522, '<td valign="top">Messy composition, sky colour looks odd, hard to see what is going on. Unsure of purpose of photo here, it doesn''t tell a story.</td>', 'Messy composition, sky colour looks odd, hard to see what is going on. Unsure of purpose of photo here, it doesn''t tell a story.', '2005-12-20 09:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1964682, 269014, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very nice b&amp;w abstract. Good contrast, but highlights on stem blown out a tad. A bit too much negative space on left for my taste.</td>', 'Very nice b&w abstract. Good contrast, but highlights on stem blown out a tad. A bit too much negative space on left for my taste.', '2005-12-20 09:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1964686, 267245, 8522, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really say 4:00-5:00am to me. Why is she awake? She doesn''t look like she''s just woken up or is about to go to sleep. Highlights on nose are burnt out and the shallow dof doesn''t work for me here.</td>', 'Doesn''t really say 4:00-5:00am to me. Why is she awake? She doesn''t look like she''s just woken up or is about to go to sleep. Highlights on nose are burnt out and the shallow dof doesn''t work for me here.', '2005-12-20 09:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1964687, 268709, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow, now this is sharp and technically well carried out. Nonetheless, there is nothing particularly original or creative about this shot, which is just a centered composition of the moon.</td>', 'Wow, now this is sharp and technically well carried out. Nonetheless, there is nothing particularly original or creative about this shot, which is just a centered composition of the moon.', '2005-12-20 09:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1964689, 267110, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours. Horizon is placed well, but the trees don''t create an interesting enough silhouette to keep my interest.</td>', 'Beautiful colours. Horizon is placed well, but the trees don''t create an interesting enough silhouette to keep my interest.', '2005-12-20 09:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1964839, 268712, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty nice, love the hue on the sky but I think this shot would have been much stronger with someones silhouette standing by the water.</td>', 'Pretty nice, love the hue on the sky but I think this shot would have been much stronger with someones silhouette standing by the water.', '2005-12-20 11:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1964848, 267126, 27482, '<td valign="top">Personally I don´t think a completely black sihouette this much without shape was the way to go here, if the title wasn´t there I would just be looking at a black blob that didn´t tell me anything.  What I am getting at is that the shape should look more like a father hugging a daughter, again, without the title I wouldn´t know what I was looking at, it could be a melted candle, some kind of wood carving or just about anything.  Anywaym, I really like the backround, very nicely lit and the wignetting looks good and the mood of the shot is pretty good so I gave it an above average rating.  (6)</td>', 'Personally I don´t think a completely black sihouette this much without shape was the way to go here, if the title wasn´t there I would just be looking at a black blob that didn´t tell me anything.  What I am getting at is that the shape should look more like a father hugging a daughter, again, without the title I wouldn´t know what I was looking at, it could be a melted candle, some kind of wood carving or just about anything.  Anywaym, I really like the backround, very nicely lit and the wignetting looks good and the mood of the shot is pretty good so I gave it an above average rating.  (6)', '2005-12-20 11:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1964853, 267110, 27482, '<td valign="top">Wow, very cool, love the "almost an silhouette forground but not quite" and the stars + reflection really make this image work.  Went straight to my favorites, don´t wanna jinx you but would be surprised to see this anywhere other than on the front page tomorrow.  (10)</td>', 'Wow, very cool, love the "almost an silhouette forground but not quite" and the stars + reflection really make this image work.  Went straight to my favorites, don´t wanna jinx you but would be surprised to see this anywhere other than on the front page tomorrow.  (10)', '2005-12-20 11:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1964857, 267024, 27482, '<td valign="top">Haha, why not a whole pot while you were at it :)  Still not completely selling me this shot, I think it needs another backround, I personally would have voted higher if there was an out of focus kitchen behind him rather than an blank wall but other than that, a very "believable early morning shot".</td>', 'Haha, why not a whole pot while you were at it :)  Still not completely selling me this shot, I think it needs another backround, I personally would have voted higher if there was an out of focus kitchen behind him rather than an blank wall but other than that, a very "believable early morning shot".', '2005-12-20 11:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1964860, 268348, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool, not quite an 10 from me but as close as can be.  I don´t know why exactly I don´t wanna give it a 10 but it just feels a bit wrong composition wise, a little bit to cramped for my taste, without having seen the rest of the scene I feel somehow like I would have liked a wider shot better.  Still an awesome shot and like I said, gave it a 9 and I don´t give out many of those.</td>', 'Pretty cool, not quite an 10 from me but as close as can be.  I don´t know why exactly I don´t wanna give it a 10 but it just feels a bit wrong composition wise, a little bit to cramped for my taste, without having seen the rest of the scene I feel somehow like I would have liked a wider shot better.  Still an awesome shot and like I said, gave it a 9 and I don´t give out many of those.', '2005-12-20 11:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1964864, 268856, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I don´t like it, the lack of focus is just irritating me and I just wanna click a grade to get to the next shot.  If you like it though, just ignore me, what the hell do I know anyways.  Just wanted to explain why I gave this a 3, would have given less if I thought it didn´t meet the challenge.</td>', 'Sorry but I don´t like it, the lack of focus is just irritating me and I just wanna click a grade to get to the next shot.  If you like it though, just ignore me, what the hell do I know anyways.  Just wanted to explain why I gave this a 3, would have given less if I thought it didn´t meet the challenge.', '2005-12-20 11:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1964877, 267033, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but the two overexposed light sources really do nothing for me but kill the shot, found myself unable to give a higher rating than 4 even though I am 100% sure its in the theme, the shot just doesn´t appeal to me.  That and the centered composition of course, was there no other more interesting angle you could have photographed the flag from?</td>', 'Sorry but the two overexposed light sources really do nothing for me but kill the shot, found myself unable to give a higher rating than 4 even though I am 100% sure its in the theme, the shot just doesn´t appeal to me.  That and the centered composition of course, was there no other more interesting angle you could have photographed the flag from?', '2005-12-20 11:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1964879, 268709, 27482, '<td valign="top">MUCH better than the other moon shot, I really like the image quality of this image, nice details, texture and while I personally find it uniteresting, technically very well done.  Gave this a 7.</td>', 'MUCH better than the other moon shot, I really like the image quality of this image, nice details, texture and while I personally find it uniteresting, technically very well done.  Gave this a 7.', '2005-12-20 11:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1964966, 268728, 22379, '<td valign="top">needed a lillte more light (see rikki''s hammer image in too early) to pull this effect off. Also -  check to see if you have a WB (white balance) setting on your camera, to aleviate some of that orange tinge.</td>', 'needed a lillte more light (see rikki''s hammer image in too early) to pull this effect off. Also -  check to see if you have a WB (white balance) setting on your camera, to aleviate some of that orange tinge.', '2005-12-20 12:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1964972, 267110, 2553, '<td valign="top">I''m curious as to how you took this shot - it is breathtakingly beautiful.  I love everything about it.  See you on the front page!</td>', 'I''m curious as to how you took this shot - it is breathtakingly beautiful.  I love everything about it.  See you on the front page!', '2005-12-20 12:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
