(1964992, 267719, 22379, '<td valign="top">That little blade of grass is distracting. Is it still green? I think the image would have been stronger without the vignetting. I like the way the watch was laid on the snow.</td>', 'That little blade of grass is distracting. Is it still green? I think the image would have been stronger without the vignetting. I like the way the watch was laid on the snow.', '2005-12-20 12:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1964993, 268899, 49032, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo of a great city.</td>', 'Beautiful photo of a great city.', '2005-12-20 12:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1964998, 266724, 22379, '<td valign="top">the fairy lights add a nice effect to this otherwise snapshotty image</td>', 'the fairy lights add a nice effect to this otherwise snapshotty image', '2005-12-20 12:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1964999, 267112, 22379, '<td valign="top">i wonder how many people have dialled that number thius week...</td>', 'i wonder how many people have dialled that number thius week...', '2005-12-20 12:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965000, 268623, 22379, '<td valign="top">i like the stark and industrial feel to this image.</td>', 'i like the stark and industrial feel to this image.', '2005-12-20 12:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965032, 268693, 48717, '<td valign="top">Although, it seems to be a bit out if focus, this pic still has a lot of impact.  The grey tones seem flat, perhaps more contrast would help.</td>', 'Although, it seems to be a bit out if focus, this pic still has a lot of impact.  The grey tones seem flat, perhaps more contrast would help.', '2005-12-20 13:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965038, 268321, 48717, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done picture, I would not change a thing.  Sad,  makes me want to cry.</td>', 'Beautifully done picture, I would not change a thing.  Sad,  makes me want to cry.', '2005-12-20 13:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965040, 268624, 47390, '<td valign="top">Wonderful idea composition etc but to much post processing and i dont really get how it fits the challenge</td>', 'Wonderful idea composition etc but to much post processing and i dont really get how it fits the challenge', '2005-12-20 13:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965043, 268639, 47390, '<td valign="top">One of the best machine shots in a long while =) (Selling machines like this myself...)</td>', 'One of the best machine shots in a long while =) (Selling machines like this myself...)', '2005-12-20 13:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965044, 268857, 48717, '<td valign="top">Great picture, seems the colors could pop a bit more.  You have them all there in the sky, but they need to be enhanced.</td>', 'Great picture, seems the colors could pop a bit more.  You have them all there in the sky, but they need to be enhanced.', '2005-12-20 13:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965050, 268877, 48717, '<td valign="top">This would have scored much better if it were not blurry.  If you don''t have a tripod, you at least need a stable surface to shoot from with the longer shutter speeds.</td>', 'This would have scored much better if it were not blurry.  If you don''t have a tripod, you at least need a stable surface to shoot from with the longer shutter speeds.', '2005-12-20 13:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965056, 268451, 48717, '<td valign="top">The vantage point for this would have been much nicer if the fence was not in the way.  Makes it a bit too busy.</td>', 'The vantage point for this would have been much nicer if the fence was not in the way.  Makes it a bit too busy.', '2005-12-20 13:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965158, 267576, 45660, '<td valign="top">Phenomenal. The sky color - phenomenal. The shack texture - phenomenal! The clouds - phenomenal!! The whole darn picture - phenomenal!!! Love it.</td>', 'Phenomenal. The sky color - phenomenal. The shack texture - phenomenal! The clouds - phenomenal!! The whole darn picture - phenomenal!!! Love it.', '2005-12-20 14:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965161, 268985, 45660, '<td valign="top">Difficult to believe, but very nice. Sky color is great.</td>', 'Difficult to believe, but very nice. Sky color is great.', '2005-12-20 14:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965326, 267750, 5885, '<td valign="top">Thinking that a motion blur on the present would have gotten the title across better.</td>', 'Thinking that a motion blur on the present would have gotten the title across better.', '2005-12-20 16:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965329, 268442, 8637, '<td valign="top">Image is not level...but nice lighting.</td>', 'Image is not level...but nice lighting.', '2005-12-20 16:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965333, 268321, 5885, '<td valign="top">OMG! What a powerful image! Awesome exposre, composition and subject matter... I was beginning to get bored voting on this challenge. This is the only 10 I''ve seen so far. AWESOME WORK!</td>', 'OMG! What a powerful image! Awesome exposre, composition and subject matter... I was beginning to get bored voting on this challenge. This is the only 10 I''ve seen so far. AWESOME WORK!', '2005-12-20 16:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965335, 269004, 5885, '<td valign="top">I know, I''m probably not the first to comment this... but that Challenge is over... lol.  <br/> <br/>Lighting and exposure are good here, but the composition lacks a little. Perhaps less water or more water... move the mountains out of the center of the pic.</td>', 'I know, I''m probably not the first to comment this... but that Challenge is over... lol.   Lighting and exposure are good here, but the composition lacks a little. Perhaps less water or more water... move the mountains out of the center of the pic.', '2005-12-20 16:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965338, 268693, 5885, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, and I like it a lot, but perhaps the focus could be sharpeneed or sharpen in post-processing with USM.</td>', 'Interesting shot, and I like it a lot, but perhaps the focus could be sharpeneed or sharpen in post-processing with USM.', '2005-12-20 16:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965341, 268915, 5885, '<td valign="top">That''s what a fridge with food looks like? LOL. Good shot, exposure is good. I only see a little problem with the composition in that there is a little too much black to the right and top... just a little tighter crop :-) Anyway, good work.</td>', 'That''s what a fridge with food looks like? LOL. Good shot, exposure is good. I only see a little problem with the composition in that there is a little too much black to the right and top... just a little tighter crop :-) Anyway, good work.', '2005-12-20 16:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965364, 268639, 44490, '<td valign="top">Great juxtaposition of serious heavy machinery and the soft snow, with wonderful lighting and exposure -- love it.</td>', 'Great juxtaposition of serious heavy machinery and the soft snow, with wonderful lighting and exposure -- love it.', '2005-12-20 16:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965368, 267110, 44490, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture, color, and exposure to get the stars - fantastic with the skyline and reflection.</td>', 'Beautiful capture, color, and exposure to get the stars - fantastic with the skyline and reflection.', '2005-12-20 16:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965373, 268321, 44490, '<td valign="top">Powerful, poignant image, great composition, color, and capture of the flames.  Just a touch more exposure might help, but that might bring up the background clutter, which really isn''t that bad as it fits the environment.  Well done.</td>', 'Powerful, poignant image, great composition, color, and capture of the flames.  Just a touch more exposure might help, but that might bring up the background clutter, which really isn''t that bad as it fits the environment.  Well done.', '2005-12-20 16:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965377, 267997, 44490, '<td valign="top">Good composition, lovely color, sharpness, and exposure - the softness of the water is an interesting contrast to the hard edges of the ice.  I''m looking forward to the exposure details.</td>', 'Good composition, lovely color, sharpness, and exposure - the softness of the water is an interesting contrast to the hard edges of the ice.  I''m looking forward to the exposure details.', '2005-12-20 16:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965392, 268865, 41746, '<td valign="top">On of the best... Strong image in its simplicity. 9.</td>', 'On of the best... Strong image in its simplicity. 9.', '2005-12-20 16:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965410, 268624, 22379, '<td valign="top">i do not care for the digital "effects" this has left the realm of photography for me.</td>', 'i do not care for the digital "effects" this has left the realm of photography for me.', '2005-12-20 17:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965417, 267033, 22379, '<td valign="top">what is the reason behind the 2 huge blown out spots in this image? Very distracting.</td>', 'what is the reason behind the 2 huge blown out spots in this image? Very distracting.', '2005-12-20 17:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965423, 268588, 22379, '<td valign="top">this looks like one of the little victorian houses that light up in christmas scenes.  Quite charming. The image probably could have done without the empty pavement.</td>', 'this looks like one of the little victorian houses that light up in christmas scenes.  Quite charming. The image probably could have done without the empty pavement.', '2005-12-20 17:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965424, 268588, 44490, '<td valign="top">Interesting colors, location, architecture, barrels, and snow.  Nice exposure and DOF - I like it a lot.</td>', 'Interesting colors, location, architecture, barrels, and snow.  Nice exposure and DOF - I like it a lot.', '2005-12-20 17:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965433, 268693, 22379, '<td valign="top">I hope you offered him some hot food for the gratitude of posing for your picture.</td>', 'I hope you offered him some hot food for the gratitude of posing for your picture.', '2005-12-20 17:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965438, 268309, 22379, '<td valign="top">tis is a really good picture of a christmas light - crisp focus and no blow outs.</td>', 'tis is a really good picture of a christmas light - crisp focus and no blow outs.', '2005-12-20 17:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965440, 268899, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, lovely color.  Could be rotated counter-clockwise just a hair, and wish you had a clearer day, but that''s just nit-picking.  Thanks for the image -- you''re making me homesick, as I''m now transplated to the NYC area.</td>', 'Nice capture, lovely color.  Could be rotated counter-clockwise just a hair, and wish you had a clearer day, but that''s just nit-picking.  Thanks for the image -- you''re making me homesick, as I''m now transplated to the NYC area.', '2005-12-20 17:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965444, 269014, 49870, '<td valign="top">Although all of the other pictures could have been taken at any time, this image is almost proof that you were really up between 4am and 5am.  Congrats</td>', 'Although all of the other pictures could have been taken at any time, this image is almost proof that you were really up between 4am and 5am.  Congrats', '2005-12-20 17:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965445, 268624, 44490, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, nice composition, especially with snow and trees -- good eye to spot it and thanks for sharing the image with us.</td>', 'Interesting image, nice composition, especially with snow and trees -- good eye to spot it and thanks for sharing the image with us.', '2005-12-20 17:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965452, 266569, 22379, '<td valign="top">the snowflakes an an extra touch of romance to the scene ;)</td>', 'the snowflakes an an extra touch of romance to the scene ;)', '2005-12-20 17:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965454, 268598, 22379, '<td valign="top">Perhaps the oversharpening was a bit overdone. But it does sort of suit this scene.</td>', 'Perhaps the oversharpening was a bit overdone. But it does sort of suit this scene.', '2005-12-20 17:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965456, 266847, 22379, '<td valign="top">looks like a pretty good hair day by me.</td>', 'looks like a pretty good hair day by me.', '2005-12-20 17:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965459, 268865, 44490, '<td valign="top">Elegant and striking image, has me wondering about a motorcycle for the single headlight path?  Wonderful, I like it a lot.</td>', 'Elegant and striking image, has me wondering about a motorcycle for the single headlight path?  Wonderful, I like it a lot.', '2005-12-20 17:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965460, 268416, 49870, '<td valign="top">If this is what you were really looking at between 4 and 5am you might be working too hard, take a break.</td>', 'If this is what you were really looking at between 4 and 5am you might be working too hard, take a break.', '2005-12-20 17:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965461, 268842, 49870, '<td valign="top">I only wish that part of the reflected images didn''t cover your face</td>', 'I only wish that part of the reflected images didn''t cover your face', '2005-12-20 17:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965464, 266940, 22379, '<td valign="top">thats a big man,.. or a small fridge.</td>', 'thats a big man,.. or a small fridge.', '2005-12-20 17:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965468, 268985, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice use of ultra-wide, I even like the feeling at "normal" viewing angles.  Lovely color and composition, interesting building, snow, benches, tree, and lights.</td>', 'Nice use of ultra-wide, I even like the feeling at "normal" viewing angles.  Lovely color and composition, interesting building, snow, benches, tree, and lights.', '2005-12-20 17:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965469, 269016, 49870, '<td valign="top">His feet . . . for someone who is asleep his feet are too tense,  it throws the whole image off for me.  Besides that I like it, especially because you used a man for the image.  I don''t think I would''ve liked it as much had you used a woman.</td>', 'His feet . . . for someone who is asleep his feet are too tense,  it throws the whole image off for me.  Besides that I like it, especially because you used a man for the image.  I don''t think I would''ve liked it as much had you used a woman.', '2005-12-20 17:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
