(1965829, 268974, 37893, '<td valign="top">I think there is too much noise and grain in this image for the average DCPer (thus our scores might suffer from their wrath). However, upon further review of this image, I see an incredibly powerful emotion that transcends through my screen. The look in your model''s eye and the way she is hugging the pillow close to her (a protection of some sort) is a wonderful potrayal of emotions. Not quite certain though as to why this was shot in a bright white room as opposed to a dark and spooky atmosphere. I rated this image pretty high but I''m certain I will be one of a few that sees this image the way I do. Good luck.</td>', 'I think there is too much noise and grain in this image for the average DCPer (thus our scores might suffer from their wrath). However, upon further review of this image, I see an incredibly powerful emotion that transcends through my screen. The look in your model''s eye and the way she is hugging the pillow close to her (a protection of some sort) is a wonderful potrayal of emotions. Not quite certain though as to why this was shot in a bright white room as opposed to a dark and spooky atmosphere. I rated this image pretty high but I''m certain I will be one of a few that sees this image the way I do. Good luck.', '2005-12-20 20:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965848, 268598, 43531, '<td valign="top">good pic, but i think you worked too much the photo, maybe with  something filters or BW it would be enough</td>', 'good pic, but i think you worked too much the photo, maybe with  something filters or BW it would be enough', '2005-12-20 21:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
