(1966764, 268883, 42984, '<td valign="top">If, as you tell us, this image was not taken between 4 and 5 am then it is <b>cheating!</b>.  I don''t know how you can accept the ribbon and feel good about yourself.<br/> <br/>The Challenge was <b><i>"Set your alarm, and take a picture between 4:00 and 5:00 AM."</i></b>... No way does a picture takem outside of those hours qualify for anything (other than a 1!)<br/> <br/>Someone who did get up in the middle of the night has been denied recognition of their efforts.  This stinks!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-21 01:57:44.</i></td>', 'If, as you tell us, this image was not taken between 4 and 5 am then it is cheating!.  I don''t know how you can accept the ribbon and feel good about yourself. The Challenge was "Set your alarm, and take a picture between 4:00 and 5:00 AM."... No way does a picture takem outside of those hours qualify for anything (other than a 1!) Someone who did get up in the middle of the night has been denied recognition of their efforts.  This stinks!', '2005-12-21 01:53:59.000000', '2005-12-21 01:57:44.000000', 0),
