(1967119, 268319, 48964, '<td valign="top">I wanted to emphasize the movement with long exposure. It was shot with 12mm from inside the fridge. I put the camera into the fridge for just a few shots, then out to warm up, then in again... so there was no problem with fog.<br/>The main problem was with composition, because you can''t see the picture and have to adjust camera all the time.<br/> <br/>Thanks for all the positive comments:)</td>', 'I wanted to emphasize the movement with long exposure. It was shot with 12mm from inside the fridge. I put the camera into the fridge for just a few shots, then out to warm up, then in again... so there was no problem with fog.The main problem was with composition, because you can''t see the picture and have to adjust camera all the time. Thanks for all the positive comments:)', '2005-12-21 04:55:12.000000', NULL, 0),
