(1967384, 267254, 48298, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all the kind and helpful comments.  My best score yet!<br/>I guess now I can ask Hendry why he suspected the time wasn''t truthful?<br/>I can guarantee that other than the Timex being three minutes fast, it was most DEFINITELY taken during the time guidelines!</td>', 'Thank you for all the kind and helpful comments.  My best score yet!I guess now I can ask Hendry why he suspected the time wasn''t truthful?I can guarantee that other than the Timex being three minutes fast, it was most DEFINITELY taken during the time guidelines!', '2005-12-21 08:57:00.000000', NULL, 0),
