(1968916, 268624, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oooooooh. . . what a cool picture, Harvey.   Very versatile for you.   An out-of-your-normal-box kind of picture, and it turned out AWESOME!   Congratulations on finishing in the top 20.   You rock. . .as usual  :)</td>', 'Oooooooh. . . what a cool picture, Harvey.   Very versatile for you.   An out-of-your-normal-box kind of picture, and it turned out AWESOME!   Congratulations on finishing in the top 20.   You rock. . .as usual  :)', '2005-12-21 17:44:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1968931, 267110, 20941, '<td valign="top">WowZee!!! Congratulations on your Blue and a Huge Score!! Stunning Image and a well deserved top spot!</td>', 'WowZee!!! Congratulations on your Blue and a Huge Score!! Stunning Image and a well deserved top spot!', '2005-12-21 17:49:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(1968937, 267110, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh my!!!!!!!!!!   I don''t know that I''ve ever seen a more deserving blue!!  <br/>Congratulations!<br/> <br/>I just added it to my favorites too.   Being one of 58 who also chose it as a favorite   WOW!</td>', 'Oh my!!!!!!!!!!   I don''t know that I''ve ever seen a more deserving blue!!  Congratulations! I just added it to my favorites too.   Being one of 58 who also chose it as a favorite   WOW!', '2005-12-21 17:51:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(1968949, 268321, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely spectacular!<br/> <br/>It just went straight to my favorites folder.  Congratulations on 4th place!!  It''s a shame to have a score like 7.1 and be in 4th place, isn''t it?  In so many challenges this would have been the clear blue stand out!  Fantastic photography!</td>', 'This is absolutely spectacular! It just went straight to my favorites folder.  Congratulations on 4th place!!  It''s a shame to have a score like 7.1 and be in 4th place, isn''t it?  In so many challenges this would have been the clear blue stand out!  Fantastic photography!', '2005-12-21 17:55:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1968953, 268709, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is an aMAZING moon shot!  CONGRATULATIONS on 6th place!</td>', 'This is an aMAZING moon shot!  CONGRATULATIONS on 6th place!', '2005-12-21 17:56:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(1968957, 268936, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is so pretty!   What amazing light and color!   Congratulations on 7th place!</td>', 'This is so pretty!   What amazing light and color!   Congratulations on 7th place!', '2005-12-21 17:57:36.000000', NULL, 0),
