(1968968, 268855, 24454, '<td valign="top">Executed to PERFECTION!   Congratulations on placing in the top 20.   This is an awesome photo!</td>', 'Executed to PERFECTION!   Congratulations on placing in the top 20.   This is an awesome photo!', '2005-12-21 18:00:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(1969031, 268597, 41574, '<td valign="top">Thank you all very much for your comments.</td>', 'Thank you all very much for your comments.', '2005-12-21 18:19:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(1969121, 266868, 42984, '<td valign="top">Yup, just a great image.  This is the one that should have come 3rd as the two above were not taken between 4 &amp; 5am.<br/> <br/>You get a Virtual Yellow from me:)<br/> <br/>Brett</td>', 'Yup, just a great image.  This is the one that should have come 3rd as the two above were not taken between 4 & 5am. You get a Virtual Yellow from me:) Brett', '2005-12-21 18:40:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(1969210, 267185, 40718, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 7 when I voted.  I like it, but I would say there is too much negative space.  If you were able to crop tighter so that the temple took up say half the picture vertically and 2/3rds horizontally, I think it would be stronger.  We would be able to see more detail in the building and I was intrigued by the colors which you could see.  It mad me curious as to what was going on there. The lone lamplight may be a distractor and were it advanced, I''d be tempted to clone it out.</td>', 'I gave this a 7 when I voted.  I like it, but I would say there is too much negative space.  If you were able to crop tighter so that the temple took up say half the picture vertically and 2/3rds horizontally, I think it would be stronger.  We would be able to see more detail in the building and I was intrigued by the colors which you could see.  It mad me curious as to what was going on there. The lone lamplight may be a distractor and were it advanced, I''d be tempted to clone it out.', '2005-12-21 19:12:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(1969241, 268321, 42013, '<td valign="top">Awesome!!! I would like to see the picture without the grain.</td>', 'Awesome!!! I would like to see the picture without the grain.', '2005-12-21 19:24:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(1969285, 268883, 43565, '<td valign="top">I guess the results will stand, but I am very disappointed to learn that the shot was not taken between 4 and 5 AM.  Kind of seems like cheating to me.</td>', 'I guess the results will stand, but I am very disappointed to learn that the shot was not taken between 4 and 5 AM.  Kind of seems like cheating to me.', '2005-12-21 19:38:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(1969296, 266868, 43565, '<td valign="top">I agree with KiwiPix--should have come in 3rd since you followed the challenge details.  At least you know you played by the rules!</td>', 'I agree with KiwiPix--should have come in 3rd since you followed the challenge details.  At least you know you played by the rules!', '2005-12-21 19:43:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(1969554, 268883, 34154, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by KiwiPix:</b></div><hr/><i>  No way does a picture takem outside of those hours qualify for anything (other than a 1!)</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Do you give 1''s to every photo that you don''t believe meets the challenge?</td>', 'Originally posted by KiwiPix:  No way does a picture takem outside of those hours qualify for anything (other than a 1!)  Do you give 1''s to every photo that you don''t believe meets the challenge?', '2005-12-21 21:25:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(1969596, 268883, 41845, '<td valign="top">this is just a beautiful image!  sorry to see all the fuss over your entry because you posted that it is actually an illusion of early morning.  hope it does not deter your love of this image it''s wonderful!</td>', 'this is just a beautiful image!  sorry to see all the fuss over your entry because you posted that it is actually an illusion of early morning.  hope it does not deter your love of this image it''s wonderful!', '2005-12-21 21:48:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(1969632, 267110, 489, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on a well deserved blue, Skip.</td>', 'Congratulations on a well deserved blue, Skip.', '2005-12-21 22:06:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(1970305, 266361, 38141, '<td valign="top">Yes, I''m seeing now how i should of turned the lamp a little more towards my face, initialy i thought the appearance of the lamp facing the camera was interesting, how it was blurred around the eges. But I see now the lighting does nothing for the lighting around me.</td>', 'Yes, I''m seeing now how i should of turned the lamp a little more towards my face, initialy i thought the appearance of the lamp facing the camera was interesting, how it was blurred around the eges. But I see now the lighting does nothing for the lighting around me.', '2005-12-22 01:57:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(1970575, 268348, 28299, '<td valign="top">Stunning photo! Isn''t that a great little camera? I''m sorry I ever let mine go. Although I know someone else is enjoying it as much as I did (and I always highly recommend Kodak).</td>', 'Stunning photo! Isn''t that a great little camera? I''m sorry I ever let mine go. Although I know someone else is enjoying it as much as I did (and I always highly recommend Kodak).', '2005-12-22 06:11:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(1970628, 268321, 48086, '<td valign="top">Indeed a very good photo, but clearly not taking during 0400-0500, which was the whole point of the challenge!</td>', 'Indeed a very good photo, but clearly not taking during 0400-0500, which was the whole point of the challenge!', '2005-12-22 07:01:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(1970663, 267110, 16241, '<td valign="top">beautiful skip!  congratulations</td>', 'beautiful skip!  congratulations', '2005-12-22 07:37:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(1970737, 267024, 49672, '<td valign="top">Not sure why this one placed where it did - I voted it as the best in the challenge.  I has an excellent ''oh, Jeez, why am I up at 4AM?!?'' feel to it, is pretty funny, works well in black &amp; white, and has good lighting.  I thought it was a great response to a difficult challenge!</td>', 'Not sure why this one placed where it did - I voted it as the best in the challenge.  I has an excellent ''oh, Jeez, why am I up at 4AM?!?'' feel to it, is pretty funny, works well in black & white, and has good lighting.  I thought it was a great response to a difficult challenge!', '2005-12-22 08:57:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(1971228, 267110, 45568, '<td valign="top">A nice piece of art. Congratulations from Belarus.</td>', 'A nice piece of art. Congratulations from Belarus.', '2005-12-22 13:08:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(1971433, 266850, 46144, '<td valign="top">The food in the pan was that evening''s dinner...meatloaf.<br/>The idea behind this was of someone who had been partying all night long, and in their drunken state, would eat just about anything!</td>', 'The food in the pan was that evening''s dinner...meatloaf.The idea behind this was of someone who had been partying all night long, and in their drunken state, would eat just about anything!', '2005-12-22 14:28:58.000000', NULL, 0),
