(1975300, 268348, 45616, '<td valign="top">Love it.  Worth the wait and getting up so early!   There is certainly a feeling of mystery and calm to the photo.  Thanks for sharing and congrats Firsty</td>', 'Love it.  Worth the wait and getting up so early!   There is certainly a feeling of mystery and calm to the photo.  Thanks for sharing and congrats Firsty', '2005-12-24 08:56:01.000000', NULL, 0),
