(2002152, 268974, 48471, '<td valign="top">An excellent photo with a great story. The only thing that bothers me is the extreme shiny left wall and the right edge of the cover, but I guess it was meant to be like that. I wish it was darker, or at least both walls having the same brightness. Thinking about it, I wish both walls were shining to the extreme with shadows cast in both, ideally one larger than the other...</td>', 'An excellent photo with a great story. The only thing that bothers me is the extreme shiny left wall and the right edge of the cover, but I guess it was meant to be like that. I wish it was darker, or at least both walls having the same brightness. Thinking about it, I wish both walls were shining to the extreme with shadows cast in both, ideally one larger than the other...', '2006-01-04 09:05:45.000000', NULL, 0),
