(2041819, 266868, 12611, '<td valign="top">This is really neat; because for the most part, you are of the school of photography that can capture essence and feel, and can also see more than the actual composition of the shot; the light, color, flow of shapes, as demonstrated by this and your other shots on this site, elucidate your mastery and proficiency in guiding your shots right where you want them.</td>', 'This is really neat; because for the most part, you are of the school of photography that can capture essence and feel, and can also see more than the actual composition of the shot; the light, color, flow of shapes, as demonstrated by this and your other shots on this site, elucidate your mastery and proficiency in guiding your shots right where you want them.', '2006-01-16 09:36:55.000000', NULL, 0),
