(2099486, 268348, 48228, '<td valign="top">Hi Keith, I really love this image, and have now added it to my favorites..... I have just become a full member of DPC, and also realized that your camera is the same as mine, which took this super shot. I also have a Kodak DX6490, and only recently realized just how good a camera it is..... Once again, I just love this image, so thank-you.....<br/></td>', 'Hi Keith, I really love this image, and have now added it to my favorites..... I have just become a full member of DPC, and also realized that your camera is the same as mine, which took this super shot. I also have a Kodak DX6490, and only recently realized just how good a camera it is..... Once again, I just love this image, so thank-you.....', '2006-01-29 21:06:13.000000', NULL, 0),
