(2128403, 268623, 27763, '<td valign="top">This rocks!  You were right to choose the image with the person in it.  The person <i>makes</i> this shot.  I took a similar shot last year.  I was trying to photograph a tunnel, when suddenly a guy walking his dogs entered into the frame.  It turned out to be the best photo of the whole series.  Like you said, having a person in the frame gives the photo life.</td>', 'This rocks!  You were right to choose the image with the person in it.  The person makes this shot.  I took a similar shot last year.  I was trying to photograph a tunnel, when suddenly a guy walking his dogs entered into the frame.  It turned out to be the best photo of the whole series.  Like you said, having a person in the frame gives the photo life.', '2006-02-06 23:21:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(2128512, 268321, 43432, '<td valign="top">poerful pic!!!</td>', 'poerful pic!!!', '2006-02-07 00:05:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(2135567, 268586, 50641, '<td valign="top">Not every photo should be crisp, clear and impeccably focussed, imo.  Regardless of the time, you caught that still-grit-in-my-eyes mood with this, the graininess works for me.  I like the flatness and the starkness of it, and the limited color range. It''s sallow. I guess if I could wish something for the photo, I''d want to stick something in that parking lot, because that''s where my eyes go, led by the lines of the bldgs.  I do however get to see the snowfall in the light, which is very harsh, realistic and not dreamy at all, good.  Yah.</td>', 'Not every photo should be crisp, clear and impeccably focussed, imo.  Regardless of the time, you caught that still-grit-in-my-eyes mood with this, the graininess works for me.  I like the flatness and the starkness of it, and the limited color range. It''s sallow. I guess if I could wish something for the photo, I''d want to stick something in that parking lot, because that''s where my eyes go, led by the lines of the bldgs.  I do however get to see the snowfall in the light, which is very harsh, realistic and not dreamy at all, good.  Yah.', '2006-02-08 22:30:40.000000', NULL, 0),
